  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikïkar ortïna kanasyanta Yeriko lasiny akwompö pipö Israel. Melö kimi chi nyo kilïtöy sany anta lïtï ori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï ECHOTYON Yoswö, “Kotönön Yeriko moriku nko pöytoghintenyi nko pikachi cho le nyökon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owitekwa kanasyante nko pich löwïr cho pö lïk kïnyïl akonga. Agh lenyoni osis mut nko akonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipöy nyu tïsï cho le mut nko odeny kontin mut nko odeny cho pö kuyo mökol ompö tawu Santuku Muma,* owitekwa nyu kanasyante kïnyïl mut nko odeny ompö asispa mut nko odeny kïmi tïsï kïkutöy kontin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kakut chane kontin kïchöghyö tya, kuteghyö pich ompö kiteghat nyo wow, kïrul nyu nayatu kanasyan lö wanka, kïpa nyu pich kutenar otini kera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïkur Yoswö tïsï akïlenchï, “Osïtö Santuku Muma akany kwip tïsï walaka cho le mut nko odeny kontin akuntaghogha Santuku ECHOTYON.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï pïchay, “Atanga tagh awit kanasyante akany kïpa tagh pipö lïk kuntaghogha Santuku Muma ECHOTYON.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa tïsichay le mut nko odeny ipöy kontin ompö tawu ECHOTYON kuntagha akikutöy kontinechoni, kïrïp nyu Santuku Muma kiyomisöto ECHOTYON chane lenyini kimwochï Yoswö pich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuntaghogha pipö lïk tïsï cho kikutöy kontin, kïrïpï Santukunoni pipö lïk walaka, otini kikutotoy tïsï kontin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kimwochï Yoswö pich lö, “Moteghyö anta angalan, amotöp ntökungwïna ngölyon kutïwekwo ntökwitïta otini omwowokwa lö, ‘Oteghyenö,’ oteghyekwa nyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kwip Santuku Muma ECHOTYON kuwit kanasyantanay kïnyïl akonga akïmïlisyö möngot akïruyö kïyech keston.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïnget Yoswö tökwoghö, kïsït tïsï Santuku Muma ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwip tïsichay le mut nko odeny kontinekwa akuntaghogha Santuku Muma ECHOTYON akïkutotoy kontinechay. Kuntaghogha pïchay pö lïk tïsï, kïrïpï Santukunoni pipö lïk walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuwit asispa odeny kanasyantanay kïnyïl akonga akïmïlisyö möngot. Kigh nyu lenyoni ompö osis mut nko akonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget kiwasan asispa mut nko odeny akuwit kanasyantanay lenyaye kïnyïl mut nko odeny. Ki asisoni onkït nyo kiwit chane kanasyan kïnyïl mut nko odeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini ketomtö kiwitata mut nko odeny akïkut tïsï kontin, kïlenchï Yoswö pïchay, “Oteghyenö! Ompöwölo kikïkonokwa ECHOTYON kanasyantanï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikengot kanasyantanï kïpöyit ECHOTYON nko tïkwïn löwïr cho mito ori atökenyar, kïpoto cheporesyantanay le Raap nko pikökwa löwïr cho mito konyi cho ngötu, ompöwölo kiwïny ghotichay kikïyonta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo okïr kegh, tömacheng tïkwïn cho kikengot kïpöyit ECHOTYON atökenyar, tömopchï chïpö nko nyarïl möngo Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kiketïlilchï ECHOTYON ropïyen nko koltin nko kari taghoy nko karïn. Kitöni tïkuchoni kaplawachpa Kö pö ECHOTYON.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
